\n<a href=\"https://github.com/emdann/pert2state_model\">https://github.com/emdann/pert2state_model</a>\n</p></li></ul></div><div class=\"section ref-list\" id=\"ref-list-1\"><h2 class=\"\">References</h2><ol class=\"cit-list ref-use-labels\"><li><span class=\"ref-label\">1.</span><a class=\"rev-xref-ref\" href=\"#xref-ref-1-1\" title=\"View reference 1. in text\" id=\"ref-1\">↵</a><div class=\"cit ref-cit ref-journal\" id=\"cit-2025.12.23.696273v1.1\" data-doi=\"10.1038/nrm2503\"><div class=\"cit-metadata\"><cite><span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Karlebach</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">G</span></span>, <span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Shamir</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">R.</span></span> <span class=\"cit-article-title\">Modelling and analysis of gene regulatory networks</span>. <abbr class=\"cit-jnl-abbrev\">Nature Reviews Molecular Cell Biology</abbr>. <span class=\"cit-pub-date\">2008</span>;<span class=\"cit-vol\">9</span>: <span class=\"cit-fpage\">770</span>–<span class=\"cit-lpage\">780</span>.<span class=\"cit-pub-id-sep cit-pub-id-doi-sep\"> </span><span class=\"cit-pub-id-scheme\">doi:</span><span class=\"cit-pub-id cit-pub-id-doi\">10.1038/nrm2503</span></cite></div><div class=\"cit-extra\"><a href=\"{openurl}?query=rft.jtitle%253DNature%2Breviews.%2BMolecular%2Bcell%2Bbiology%26rft.stitle%253DNat%2BRev%2BMol%2BCell%2BBiol%26rft.aulast%253DKarlebach%26rft.auinit1%253DG.%26rft.volume%253D9%26rft.issue%253D10%26rft.spage%253D770%26rft.epage%253D780%26rft.atitle%253DModelling%2Band%2Banalysis%2Bof%2Bgene%2Bregulatory%2Bnetworks.%26rft_id%253Dinfo%253Adoi%252F10.1038%252Fnrm2503%26rft_id%253Dinfo%253Apmid%252F18797474%26rft.genre%253Darticle%26rft_val_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Ajournal%26ctx_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ver%253DZ39.88-2004%26url_ctx_fmt%253Dinfo%253Aofi%252Ffmt%253Akev%253Amtx%253Actx\" class=\"cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-openurl cit-ref-sprinkles-open-url\"><span>OpenUrl</span></a><a href=\"/lookup/external-ref?access_num=10.1038/nrm2503&amp;link_type=DOI\" class=\"cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-doi cit-ref-sprinkles-crossref\"><span>CrossRef</span></a><a href=\"/lookup/external-ref?access_num=18797474&amp;link_type=MED&amp;atom=%2Fbiorxiv%2Fearly%2F2025%2F12%2F24%2F2025.12.23.696273.atom\" class=\"cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-medline\"><span>PubMed</span></a><a href=\"/lookup/external-ref?access_num=000259402800011&amp;link_type=ISI\" class=\"cit-ref-sprinkles cit-ref-sprinkles-newisilink cit-ref-sprinkles-webofscience\"><span>Web of Science</span></a></div></div></li><li><span class=\"ref-label\">2.</span><a class=\"rev-xref-ref\" href=\"#xref-ref-2-1\" title=\"View reference 2. in text\" id=\"ref-2\">↵</a><div class=\"cit ref-cit ref-journal\" id=\"cit-2025.12.23.696273v1.2\" data-doi=\"10.1038/ng.3487\"><div class=\"cit-metadata\"><cite><span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Rackham</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">OJL</span></span>, <span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Firas</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">J</span></span>, <span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Fang</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">H</span></span>, <span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Oates</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">ME</span></span>, <span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Holmes</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">ML</span></span>, <span class=\"cit-auth\"><span class=\"cit-name-surname\">Knaupp</span>  <span class=\"cit-name-given-names\">AS</span></span>, <span class=\"cit-etal\">et al.</span> <span class=\"cit-article-title\">A predictive computational framework for direct reprogramming between human cell types</span>. <abbr class=\"cit-jnl-abbrev\">Nature Genetics</abbr>. <span class=\"cit-pub-date\">2016</span>;<span class=\"cit-vol\">48</span>: <s