, Vienna, Austria.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Traxler P\",\"lastName\":\"Traxler\",\"firstName\":\"Peter\",\"initials\":\"P\",\"authorId\":{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-0373-8839\"},\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"CeMM Research Center for Molecular Medicine of the Austrian Academy of Sciences, Vienna, Austria.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Klughammer J\",\"lastName\":\"Klughammer\",\"firstName\":\"Johanna\",\"initials\":\"J\",\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"CeMM Research Center for Molecular Medicine of the Austrian Academy of Sciences, Vienna, Austria.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Schuster LC\",\"lastName\":\"Schuster\",\"firstName\":\"Linda C\",\"initials\":\"LC\",\"authorId\":{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-3470-5490\"},\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"CeMM Research Center for Molecular Medicine of the Austrian Academy of Sciences, Vienna, Austria.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Kuchler A\",\"lastName\":\"Kuchler\",\"firstName\":\"Amelie\",\"initials\":\"A\",\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"CeMM Research Center for Molecular Medicine of the Austrian Academy of Sciences, Vienna, Austria.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Alpar D\",\"lastName\":\"Alpar\",\"firstName\":\"Donat\",\"initials\":\"D\",\"authorId\":{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-2638-5418\"},\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"CeMM Research Center for Molecular Medicine of the Austrian Academy of Sciences, Vienna, Austria.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Bock C\",\"lastName\":\"Bock\",\"firstName\":\"Christoph\",\"initials\":\"C\",\"authorId\":{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0001-6091-3088\"},\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"CeMM Research Center for Molecular Medicine of the Austrian Academy of Sciences, Vienna, Austria.\"},{\"affiliation\":\"Department of Laboratory Medicine, Medical University of Vienna, Vienna, Austria.\"},{\"affiliation\":\"Max Planck Institute for Informatics, Saarland Informatics Campus, Saarbrücken, Germany.\"}]}}]},\"authorIdList\":{\"authorId\":[{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0001-6091-3088\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0001-9362-5373\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-0522-202X\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-1374-0329\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-2638-5418\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-0373-8839\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-3470-5490\"}]},\"dataLinksTagsList\":{\"dataLinkstag\":[\"supporting_data\",\"recommended_reviews\",\"related_data\",\"wikipedia\"]},\"journalInfo\":{\"issue\":\"3\",\"volume\":\"14\",\"journalIssueId\":2532311,\"dateOfPublication\":\"2017 Mar\",\"monthOfPublication\":3,\"yearOfPublication\":2017,\"journal\":{\"medlineAbbreviation\":\"Nat Methods\",\"title\":\"Nature methods\",\"essn\":\"1548-7105\",\"issn\":\"1548-7091\",\"nlmid\":\"101215604\",\"isoabbreviation\":\"Nat Methods\"},\"printPublicationDate\":\"2017-03-01\"},\"pubYear\":\"2017\",\"pageInfo\":\"297-301\",\"abstractText\":\"CRISPR-based genetic screens are accelerating biological discovery, but current methods have inherent limitations. Widely used pooled screens are restricted to simple readouts including cell proliferation and sortable marker proteins. Arrayed screens allow for comprehensive molecular readouts such as transcriptome profiling, but at much lower throughput. Here we combine pooled CRISPR screening with single-cell RNA sequencing into a broadly applicable workflow, directly linking guide RNA expression to transcriptome responses in thousands of individual cells. Our method for CRISPR droplet sequencing (CROP-seq) enables pooled CRISPR screens with single-cell transcriptome resolution, which will facilitate high-throughput functional dissection of complex regulatory mechanisms and heterogeneous cell populations.\",\"affiliation\":\"CeMM Research Center for Molecular Medicine of the Austrian Academy of Sciences, Vienna, Austria.\",\"publicationStatus\":\"ppublish\",\"language\":\"eng\",\"pubModel\":\"Print-Electronic\",\"pubTypeList\":{\"pubType\":[\"Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't\",\"research-article\",\"Journal Article\"]},\"grantsList\":{\"grant\":[{\"agency\":\"Austrian Science Fund FWF\",\"acronym\":\"FWF_\",\"grantId\":\"I 1626\",\"orderIn\":0},{\"agency\":\"European Research Council\",\"acronym\":\"ERC_\",\"grantId\":\"679146\",\"orderIn\":0}]},\"meshHeadingList\":{\"meshHeading\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Cell Line\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Humans\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Gene Expression Profiling\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"abbreviation\":\"MT\",\"qualifierName\":\"methods\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Sequence Analysis, RNA\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"abbreviation\":\"MT\",\"qualifierName\":\"methods\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Cell Proliferation\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"HEK293 Cells\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Single-Cell Analysis\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"abbreviation\":\"MT\",\"qualifierName\":\"methods\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"High-Throughput Nucleotide Sequencing\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"abbreviation\":\"MT\",\"qualifierName\":\"methods\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Transcriptome\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"abbreviation\":\"GE\",\"qualifierName\":\"genetics\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Clustered Regularly Interspaced Short Palindromic Repeats\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"abbreviation\":\"GE\",\"qualifierName\":\"genetics\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"RNA, Guide, CRISPR-Cas Systems\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"abbreviation\":\"GE\",\"qualifierName\":\"genetics\"}]}}]},\"chemicalList\":{\"chemical\":[{\"name\":\"RNA, Guide, CRISPR-Cas Systems\",\"registryNumber\":\"0\"}]},\"subsetList\":{\"subset\":[{\"code\":\"IM\",\"name\":\"Index Medicus\"}]},\"fullTextUrlList\":{\"fullTextUrl\":[{\"availability\":\"Free\",\"availabilityCode\":\"F\",\"documentStyle\":\"pdf\",\"site\":\"Unpaywall\",\"url\":\"https://www.nature.com/articles/nmeth.4177.pdf\"},{\"availability\":\"Subscription required\",\"availabilityCode\":\"S\",\"documentStyle\":\"doi\",\"site\":\"DOI\",\"url\":\"https://doi.org/10.1038/nmeth.4177\"},{\"availability\":\"Open access\",\"availabilityCode\":\"OA\",\"documentStyle\":\"html\",\"site\":\"Europe_PMC\",\"url\":\"https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC5334791\"},{\"availability\":\"Open access\",\"availabilityCode\":\"OA\",\"documentStyle\":\"pdf\",\"site\":\"Europe_PMC\",\"url\":\"https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC5334791?pdf=render\"}]},\"commentCorrectionList\":{\"commentCorrection\":[{\"source\":\"MED\",\"id\":\"28245215\",\"reference\":\"Nat Methods. 2017 Feb 28;14(3):237-238. doi: 10.1038/nmeth.4196.\",\"type\":\"Comment in\",\"orderIn\":1},{\"source\":\"MED\",\"id\":\"28398325\",\"reference\":\"Nat Biotechnol. 2017 Apr 11;35(4):339-340. doi: 10.1038/nbt.3849.\",\"type\":\"Comment in\",\"orderIn\":2},{\"source\":\"PPR\",\"id\":\"PPR29426\",\"type\":\"Preprint in\",\"note\":\"CrossRef Pre-print loader\",\"orderIn\":10002}]},\"isOpenAccess\":\"Y\",\"inEPMC\":\"Y\",\"inPMC\":\"Y\",\"citedByCount\":1071,\"hasReferences\":\"Y\",\"hasTextMinedTerms\":\"Y\",\"hasDbCrossReferences\":\"Y\",\"dbCrossReferenceList\":{\"dbName\":[\"EMBL\"]},\"hasPDF\":\"Y\",\"hasBook\":\"N\",\"hasSuppl\":\"Y\",\"hasLabsLinks\":\"Y\",\"hasData\":\"Y\",\"authMan\":\"Y\",\"epmcAuthMan\":\"Y\",\"nihAuthMan\":\"N\",\"manuscriptId\":\"EMS71051\",\"hasTMAccessionNumbers\":\"Y\",\"tmAccessionTypeList\":{\"accessionType\":[\"geo\",\"doi\"]},\"dateOfCompletion\":\"2017-06-26\",\"dateOfCreation\":\"2017-01-19\",\"dateOfRevision\":\"2025-05-30\",\"electronicPublicationDate\":\"2017-01-18\",\"firstPublicationDate\":\"2017-01-18\",\"firstIndexDate\":\"2017-01-19\",\"fullTextReceivedDate\":\"2025-11-25\",\"hasEvaluations\":\"N\"}]}}",
