9/NIHMS71051-supplement-Supplementary_Table_2.xlsx?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 21918?></media></supplementary-material><supplementary-material id=\"db_ds_supplementary-material7_reqid_\" position=\"float\"><?disp-level 2?><label>Supplementary Table 3</label><media xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"NIHMS71051-supplement-Supplementary_Table_3.xlsx\" mimetype=\"application\" mime-subtype=\"vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\"><?cloudpmc-path e2a0/5334791/eb611e7401db/NIHMS71051-supplement-Supplementary_Table_3.xlsx?><?cloudpmc-bucket app?><?size 29040?></media></supplementary-material></sec></sec></body></article>",
