  "content_type": "geo/text",
  "text": "^SAMPLE = GSM6630380\r\n!Sample_title = Differentiated HSPCs, 4 arrayed lentiviruses, rep 1, scRNA-seq\r\n!Sample_geo_accession = GSM6630380\r\n!Sample_status = Public on May 02 2023\r\n!Sample_submission_date = Oct 11 2022\r\n!Sample_last_update_date = May 02 2023\r\n!Sample_type = SRA\r\n!Sample_channel_count = 1\r\n!Sample_source_name_ch1 = Hematopoietic system\r\n!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens\r\n!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: Differentiated hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: Hematopoietic system\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = library type: mRNA\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = antibodies/tags: none\r\n!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA\r\n!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Following final FACS enrichment to remove debris and purify transduced cells, 5-mL PBS-BSA coated tubes described above were spun down at 400 x g for 5 minutes at 4ºC. The entire supernatant was carefully removed and 1mL of PBS+0.05% BSA was added. Cells were then counted twice using an automated Countess 2 cell counter (Thermo Fisher, I-CACC2). Cell viability as determined by Trypan Blue was always >95%. Cells were again washed with 5mL PBS+0.05% BSA and resuspended at a final concentration of 1,000 cells / µL and kept on ice.\r\n!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Single-cells were immediately processed using v3.1 Chemistry Dual Index kits according to manufacturer’s instructions (10X Genomics), using 20µL of cell suspension and 23.2 µL of water on the cell suspension loading step. Libraries were sequenced using a 28 base pair (Read 1), 10 base pair (Index 1), 10 base pair (Index 2), 90 base pair (Read 2) configuration on Nextseq 500, Nextseq 2000 or Novaseq S2/S4 instruments.\r\n!Sample_description = 10x Genomics\r\n!Sample_description = perturb_seq_CD33_rep1_filtered_feature_bc_matrix.h5\r\n!Sample_data_processing = The demultiplexing, barcoded processing, gene counting and aggregation were made using the Cell Ranger software v6.0.1 (https://support.10xgenomics.com/single-cell-gene-expression/software/pipelines/latest/what-is-cell-ranger).\r\n!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: hg38\r\n!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: h5 files, contains gene expression matrices and cropseq transcript matrices, and barcoded antibody matrices (if applicable)\r\n!Sample_platform_id = GPL18573\r\n!Sample_contact_name = Jorge Diego,,Martin Rufino\r\n!Sample_contact_institute = Harvard University / Broad Institute of MIT and Harvard / Boston Children's Hospital\r\n!Sample_contact_address = 415 Main Street\r\n!Sample_contact_city = Cambridge\r\n!Sample_contact_state = MA\r\n!Sample_contact_zip/postal_code = 02142\r\n!Sample_contact_country = USA\r\n!Sample_instrument_model = NextSeq 500\r\n!Sample_library_selection = cDNA\r\n!Sample_library_source = transcriptomic single cell\r\n!Sample_library_strategy = RNA-Seq\r\n!Sample_relation = BioSample: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/biosample/SAMN31245612\r\n!Sample_relation = SRA: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra?term=SRX17921167\r\n!Sample_supplementary_file_1 = NONE\r\n!Sample_series_id = GSE215253\r\n!Sample_data_row_count = 0\r\n^SAMPLE = GSM6630381\r\n!Sample_title = Differentiated HSPCs, 4 arrayed lentiviruses, rep 1, barcoded antibody (ADT)\r\n!Sample_geo_accession = GSM6630381\r\n!Sample_status = Public on May 02 2023\r\n!Sample_submission_date = Oct 11 2022\r\n!Sample_last_update_date = May 02 2023\r\n!Sample_type = SRA\r\n!Sample_channel_count = 1\r\n!Sample_source_name_ch1 = Hematopoietic system\r\n!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens\r\n!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: Differentiated hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: Hematopoietic system\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = library type: ADT\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = antibodies/tags: TotalSeq™-B0052 anti-human CD33 Antibody\r\n!Sample_molecule_ch1 = protein\r\n!Sa