  "text": "^SAMPLE = GSM8377062\r\n!Sample_title = Disomic Day 10 hiPSC-CM, Replicate 1, scRNAseq\r\n!Sample_geo_accession = GSM8377062\r\n!Sample_status = Public on Aug 25 2025\r\n!Sample_submission_date = Jul 03 2024\r\n!Sample_last_update_date = Aug 25 2025\r\n!Sample_type = SRA\r\n!Sample_channel_count = 1\r\n!Sample_source_name_ch1 = iPSC Cardiac Differentiation\r\n!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens\r\n!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: iPSC Cardiac Differentiation\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: iPSC Cardiac Differentiation\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: iPSC Cardiac Differentiation\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: Disomic\r\n!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: none\r\n!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = For CROP-seq and sgRNA treatments, lentivirus infection of hiPSCs was performed. Lentivirus was generated in 293T cells and purified using Lenti-X concentrator.\r\n!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Trisomic DS1 (UWWC1-DS1) and isogenic control disomic DS2U (UWWC1-DS2U) hiPSC lines were obtained through WiCell (Madison, WI). Both cell lines were transitioned from mTeSR1 media (Stemcell Technologies, 85850) to E8 media (ThermoFisher Scientific, A1517001) and grown on hESC-Qualified Matrigel (Millipore, CLS354277). Cells were passaged by enzymatic dissociation using Accutase (ThermoFisher Scientific, 00-4555-56) when 70-80% confluent in E8 media containing Y-27632 for the first day of passaging (Stemcell Technologies, 72308).\r\n!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA\r\n!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = hiPSCs were extracted using Accutase, which was neutralized by dilution with PBS. Day 20 cardiomyocytes were extracted using 0.25% Trypsin and neutralized with PBS+1% FBS\r\n!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = All library construction steps were performed according to manufacturer's protocols. Samples were uniformly treated with 9 PCR cycles at cDNA step and 9 PCR cycles at library amplification steps.\r\n!Sample_